{"slug": "S02E10", "video_name": "Community - S02E10 - Mixology Certification Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E10 - Mixology Certification Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1241.957, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "groq", "stt_model": "whisper-large-v3", "segment_count": 517, "segments": [{"start": 1.0, "end": 3.0, "text": "To you!"}, {"start": 3.0, "end": 5.0, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 5.0, "end": 6.0, "text": "That was weird."}, {"start": 6.0, "end": 8.0, "text": "How come we only sang the last two words?"}, {"start": 8.0, "end": 9.0, "text": "What happened to the happy birthday part?"}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 11.0, "text": "Well, you know Troy's a Jehovah's Witness."}, {"start": 11.0, "end": 12.0, "text": "He doesn't celebrate birthdays."}, {"start": 12.0, "end": 14.0, "text": "Annie and I did our best to keep the language on the cake compliant."}, {"start": 14.0, "end": 17.1875, "text": "Hello during a random dessert, the month and day of"}, {"start": 17.1875, "end": 21.0, "text": "which coincide numerically with your expulsion from a uterus."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 24.0, "text": "You guys, I never cried, but..."}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 25.0, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 25.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "Happy expulsion, Troy."}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "But after cake, we cram four realsies."}, {"start": 29.0, "end": 31.0, "text": "These guys finals are coming up."}, {"start": 31.0, "end": 34.0, "text": "Yeah, this group is talking to you special occasions to avoid studying."}, {"start": 34.0, "end": 35.806451612903224, "text": "I mean, last week we had fondue and played"}, {"start": 35.806451612903224, "end": 38.0, "text": "boggle because Shirley's niece took her first bath."}, {"start": 38.0, "end": 39.0, "text": "With bubbles."}, {"start": 39.0, "end": 39.74074074074074, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 39.74074074074074, "end": 41.0, "text": "It's a milestone."}, {"start": 41.0, "end": 45.0, "text": "Funny because last week was my birthday and nobody noticed and nobody cared."}, {"start": 47.918699999999994, "end": 50.918699999999994, "text": "Pierce, you don't remember the huge party we threw?"}, {"start": 50.918699999999994, "end": 53.03869999999999, "text": "We need to talk about those painkillers you're taking"}, {"start": 53.03869999999999, "end": 54.918699999999994, "text": "because I don't think you remember any of them."}, {"start": 54.918699999999994, "end": 56.918699999999994, "text": "That was a huge party."}, {"start": 56.918699999999994, "end": 58.918699999999994, "text": "It was the best party of my life."}, {"start": 58.918699999999994, "end": 60.918699999999994, "text": "You should kiss ya."}, {"start": 60.918699999999994, "end": 63.305934042553176, "text": "Of course I remember my birthdays."}, {"start": 63.305934042553176, "end": 64.21869999999998, "text": "What a party."}, {"start": 65.31869999999999, "end": 67.43869999999998, "text": "Yeah, you still owe me for the keg deposit."}, {"start": 67.67869999999999, "end": 69.77869999999999, "text": "Oh, you think I don't know that?"}, {"start": 70.57869600000001, "end": 70.87869999999998, "text": "Troy."}, {"start": 72.49869999999999, "end": 73.09870000000001, "text": "Troy."}, {"start": 73.09870000000001, "end": 89.75425555555556, "text": "Thank"}, {"start": 89.75425555555556, "end": 103.0787, "text": "you."}, {"start": 103.09870000000001, "end": 104.7987, "text": "Punch in Detroit?"}, {"start": 104.7987, "end": 105.49869999999999, "text": "No way!"}, {"start": 105.77869999999999, "end": 106.71869999999998, "text": "This is sold out everywhere."}, {"start": 106.9787, "end": 107.52016341463414, "text": "Not everywhere."}, {"start": 107.52016341463414, "end": 108.4587, "text": "I got a cousin in Detroit."}, {"start": 108.65869999999998, "end": 109.67869999999999, "text": "They're not crazy about it up there."}, {"start": 109.99869999999999, "end": 111.11869999999999, "text": "This is how you turn 20."}, {"start": 111.61869999999999, "end": 112.05869999999999, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 112.71869999999998, "end": 114.09870000000001, "text": "Ooh, strawberries under there."}, {"start": 114.11869999999999, "end": 115.67869999999999, "text": "Here, let me help you with that."}, {"start": 115.71869999999998, "end": 117.33869999999999, "text": "I broke my legs, not my gender."}, {"start": 117.61869999999999, "end": 117.9787, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 118.6987, "end": 121.0787, "text": "While we're watching this unfold,"}, {"start": 121.0787, "end": 123.89869999999999, "text": "some birthday facts to enjoy."}, {"start": 124.5387, "end": 126.99869999999999, "text": "Troy's birthday is tomorrow, December 4th."}, {"start": 127.07869600000001, "end": 130.2387, "text": "Also born that day, Tyra Banks, Marissa Tomei,"}, {"start": 130.4187, "end": 132.9587, "text": "and French cinematographer Claude Renoir."}, {"start": 132.9587, "end": 133.29203333333334, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 133.29203333333334, "end": 133.9587, "text": "Jackpot."}, {"start": 133.9587, "end": 137.37869, "text": "On the Chinese calendar, Troy is a horse, like me,"}, {"start": 137.8987, "end": 140.1187, "text": "purposeful, self-possessed, and gregarious."}, {"start": 140.4187, "end": 142.0387, "text": "No, I'm pretty sure I'm a snake."}, {"start": 142.49869, "end": 145.29869, "text": "I remember because I'm determined, self-possessed, and mendacious."}, {"start": 145.85869, "end": 151.30574243902439, "text": "Pierce what is this What are you doing Explain yourself Who made this crappy cake"}, {"start": 151.30574243902439, "end": 155.74408146341463, "text": "anyway A cake maker at a cake store They did it wrong Troy we 1990"}, {"start": 155.74408146341463, "end": 159.64444, "text": "We horses I was born in 89 Then you were born 21 years ago"}, {"start": 159.74443, "end": 162.98443, "text": "Which would make me 20, because everyone is 10 for two years."}, {"start": 164.36444, "end": 166.82443, "text": "Because fifth grade is really hard for everyone."}, {"start": 167.42444, "end": 169.24443, "text": "Mom, how many lives have I been living?"}, {"start": 169.24443, "end": 172.03861604651163, "text": "Troy, do you realize that at midnight you are"}, {"start": 172.03861604651163, "end": 174.58443, "text": "turning 21, as in the legal drinking age?"}, {"start": 175.50442, "end": 175.86444, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 176.50442, "end": 177.96443, "text": "This party just became unacceptable."}, {"start": 178.32443, "end": 179.06444, "text": "We're going out."}, {"start": 179.20444, "end": 181.64444, "text": "Yep, but you guys were just complaining about us having too many parties."}, {"start": 181.70444, "end": 182.40443, "text": "Too many lame ones."}, {"start": 182.56444, "end": 183.10443, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 183.22443, "end": 184.10443, "text": "Well, what makes it real?"}, {"start": 184.24443, "end": 186.90443, "text": "Well, Shirley, think of it as Troy taking his first bath."}, {"start": 187.00442, "end": 188.54443, "text": "Only the bubbles are his manhood."}, {"start": 188.76443, "end": 189.12443, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 189.22443, "end": 190.38443, "text": "I want to bathe in manhood."}, {"start": 190.48443, "end": 190.84444, "text": "Aw."}, {"start": 191.98443, "end": 193.28442, "text": "I'm taking you to L Street."}, {"start": 194.02443, "end": 195.82443, "text": "Ugh, douche street."}, {"start": 195.82443, "end": 197.58444, "text": "Oh, of course you hate cool bars."}, {"start": 197.82443, "end": 199.98443, "text": "I don't suppose you've ever even been to L Street."}, {"start": 200.44443, "end": 202.56444, "text": "No, but I also haven't been to Beirut."}, {"start": 202.56444, "end": 205.27871666666667, "text": "But I'm sure I will go one day because"}, {"start": 205.27871666666667, "end": 208.56442, "text": "I hear they have lots of important cultural..."}, {"start": 209.16443, "end": 210.42444, "text": "Oh, it's my birthday."}, {"start": 211.00442, "end": 213.54443, "text": "Unlike L Street, which is douchey."}, {"start": 213.70444, "end": 215.20444, "text": "All right, let's hear your great suggestions."}, {"start": 215.40442, "end": 216.14444, "text": "The Red Door."}, {"start": 216.26443, "end": 218.50442, "text": "Oh, yeah, the Red Door, the red hipster."}, {"start": 218.78442, "end": 219.36192375000002, "text": "Not hipster."}, {"start": 219.36192375000002, "end": 221.0463096875, "text": "Hipsters haven't discovered it yet."}, {"start": 221.0463096875, "end": 221.86444, "text": "It's underground."}, {"start": 222.18443, "end": 224.3664488607595, "text": "Why don't we go someplace fun like Peg Leg Pablo's?"}, {"start": 224.3664488607595, "end": 225.56442, "text": "They serve virgin mudslides."}, {"start": 226.18443, "end": 227.50442, "text": "Those are milkshakes, Shirley."}, {"start": 227.68443, "end": 230.01442500000002, "text": "You guys, all you think about is yourselves."}, {"start": 230.01442500000002, "end": 230.80874147727275, "text": "Think about me."}, {"start": 230.80874147727275, "end": 231.17942250000002, "text": "I'm 19."}, {"start": 231.17942250000002, "end": 232.34442, "text": "I can't get into bars."}, {"start": 232.56442, "end": 234.12442000000001, "text": "Well, yeah, that must be awful."}, {"start": 234.28442, "end": 235.12442000000001, "text": "I'll bring you a mudslide."}, {"start": 235.26443, "end": 237.68443, "text": "Okay, well, have fun."}, {"start": 240.60443, "end": 242.10443, "text": "Fine, I'll get Annie an ID."}, {"start": 242.26443, "end": 243.00442, "text": "A fake ID?"}, {"start": 243.12442000000001, "end": 243.82443, "text": "It will be real."}, {"start": 243.92444, "end": 244.86444, "text": "It just won't be yours."}, {"start": 244.98443, "end": 246.30443, "text": "I will see you at the red door."}, {"start": 246.34442, "end": 246.70444, "text": "Nice try."}, {"start": 246.76443, "end": 248.28442, "text": "We're not going to Red Poet Society."}, {"start": 248.46443, "end": 250.60443, "text": "Well, we're not going to Douche Street either."}, {"start": 250.74443, "end": 250.92444, "text": "Fine."}, {"start": 251.10443, "end": 251.56442, "text": "Count of three."}, {"start": 251.66443, "end": 253.54443, "text": "Name the least offensive bar you've ever been to."}, {"start": 253.74443, "end": 255.04443, "text": "One, two, three."}, {"start": 255.58443, "end": 256.26443, "text": "Flanaghan's Hole."}, {"start": 256.50442, "end": 256.76443, "text": "Done."}, {"start": 257.16443, "end": 258.04443, "text": "Troy, you ride with me?"}, {"start": 258.22443, "end": 259.26443, "text": "Do you even have to ask?"}, {"start": 259.96442, "end": 261.32443, "text": "Uh, Pierce, do you want to ride in my van?"}, {"start": 261.32443, "end": 262.30444, "text": "I'm not a disabled."}, {"start": 262.56442, "end": 266.42444, "text": "I don't need people helping me do normal things and doting over me."}, {"start": 266.62442, "end": 267.50442, "text": "Why don't you just leave?"}, {"start": 269.22443, "end": 271.32443, "text": "Okay, I'll beat you there."}, {"start": 272.14444, "end": 274.10443, "text": "I don't think this girl looks very much like me."}, {"start": 274.40442, "end": 276.0844, "text": "Come on, she's a white brunette."}, {"start": 276.38443, "end": 277.40442, "text": "So is Anna Hathaway."}, {"start": 278.04443, "end": 278.5844, "text": "Go on."}, {"start": 278.70444, "end": 280.54443, "text": "What's your friend doing with a stack of other people's IDs?"}, {"start": 281.04443, "end": 281.76443, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 281.88443, "end": 285.28442, "text": "Sometimes people sell their ID when they're leaving the state and need cash."}, {"start": 285.28442, "end": 289.60443, "text": "So she's a drifter, a floater, an urchin."}, {"start": 290.0244, "end": 292.12445, "text": "Caroline Decker from Corpus Christi, Texas."}, {"start": 292.56442, "end": 293.11826615384615, "text": "Texas?"}, {"start": 293.11826615384615, "end": 294.96442, "text": "Do I need an accent?"}, {"start": 295.28442, "end": 296.38443, "text": "You don't need an accent."}, {"start": 297.3244, "end": 300.9736338738739, "text": "Howdy y I Caroline Decker Please don do that I"}, {"start": 300.9736338738739, "end": 306.13016, "text": "guarantee That Cajun I should research Corpus Christi Fanny relax"}, {"start": 306.57016, "end": 308.17963368421056, "text": "I'm not a relaxed person, Britta."}, {"start": 308.17963368421056, "end": 308.86244070175445, "text": "I think ahead."}, {"start": 308.86244070175445, "end": 309.35016, "text": "I prepare."}, {"start": 309.71017, "end": 312.51016, "text": "I don't improvise my life like Caroline Decker,"}, {"start": 312.67016, "end": 315.67016, "text": "who probably has really bad credit and an unfinished mermaid tattoo."}, {"start": 316.85016, "end": 317.33017, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 317.89017, "end": 319.21017, "text": "Flanahan's hole is closed."}, {"start": 319.99017, "end": 320.83183249999996, "text": "That's not a..."}, {"start": 320.83183249999996, "end": 322.01016, "text": "I'm not being clever."}, {"start": 322.65018, "end": 323.61017, "text": "I mean, it's out of business."}, {"start": 323.61017, "end": 325.59015, "text": "Well, that's what they get for trying to please everyone."}, {"start": 326.45016, "end": 327.29016, "text": "So now what?"}, {"start": 327.31018, "end": 328.67016, "text": "Well, there's a place at 3rd and Water."}, {"start": 328.85016, "end": 331.63016, "text": "It's fun, divey, but not staff infection divey."}, {"start": 332.27017, "end": 335.27017, "text": "It's either got a gross name or an ironically fancy one."}, {"start": 335.75015, "end": 336.49017, "text": "Possibly both."}, {"start": 336.55017, "end": 337.5701777272727, "text": "Oh, the ballroom."}, {"start": 337.5701777272727, "end": 337.87018, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 338.11017, "end": 338.99017, "text": "Go to 3rd and Water."}, {"start": 339.55017, "end": 340.246833, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 340.246833, "end": 341.45016, "text": "That wasn't a deal."}, {"start": 341.67016, "end": 342.51016, "text": "Shirley's pushing back."}, {"start": 342.51016, "end": 342.7934386885246, "text": "Oh, why?"}, {"start": 342.7934386885246, "end": 344.67016, "text": "Because they don't have plastic menus and milkshakes?"}, {"start": 344.79016, "end": 344.87016133333333, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 344.87016133333333, "end": 345.39017, "text": "Because they don't have..."}, {"start": 345.39017, "end": 346.47015, "text": "Don't repeat that, you goon!"}, {"start": 347.15018, "end": 348.83017, "text": "Jeez, look, just..."}, {"start": 348.83017, "end": 351.83017, "text": "The women are your problem, and the men are going to the ballroom."}, {"start": 352.13016, "end": 353.53015, "text": "And now I guess I am being clever."}, {"start": 353.53015, "end": 357.85016, "text": "So, plastic menus are bad?"}, {"start": 358.35016, "end": 360.49017, "text": "See, this is the kind of stuff I need to learn"}, {"start": 360.49017, "end": 362.95016, "text": "Like, plastic menus seem like a great idea to me"}, {"start": 362.95016, "end": 365.15015, "text": "But when you spill something on them and then your mom says"}, {"start": 365.15015, "end": 367.51016, "text": "Hey, Troy, you're ruining Fuddruckers for everyone"}, {"start": 367.51016, "end": 369.85016, "text": "Troy, you're entering the next chapter of your life"}, {"start": 369.85016, "end": 372.01016, "text": "Sadly, it's the final chapter"}, {"start": 372.01016, "end": 373.13016, "text": "But it's also the longest"}, {"start": 373.13016, "end": 375.13016, "text": "And if you play it right, the best"}, {"start": 375.13016, "end": 377.45016, "text": "You and I, we're just two guys now"}, {"start": 377.45016, "end": 378.41016, "text": "Peers"}, {"start": 378.41016, "end": 379.73016, "text": "Equals"}, {"start": 379.73016, "end": 381.53015, "text": "So awesome"}, {"start": 381.53015, "end": 383.37018, "text": "Maybe later you'll let me drive your car"}, {"start": 383.37018, "end": 389.81017245901637, "text": "hello former enemy he's"}, {"start": 389.81017245901637, "end": 395.1301662295082, "text": "21 at midnight cool"}, {"start": 395.1301662295082, "end": 400.45016, "text": "yeah happy birthday"}, {"start": 400.45016, "end": 406.37018, "text": "oh i don't like this place ah you made that clear shirley oi vey"}, {"start": 406.37018, "end": 409.2792911111111, "text": "londekker from corpus christi annie you don't need an"}, {"start": 409.2792911111111, "end": 411.31018, "text": "accent if my id says texas they'll be"}, {"start": 411.31018, "end": 414.21017, "text": "They're not going to question your ID because you're a hot girl."}, {"start": 414.75018, "end": 415.87018, "text": "We're good for business."}, {"start": 416.05017, "end": 418.47015, "text": "The hotter you are, the more they'll risk the fine."}, {"start": 422.61017, "end": 423.13016, "text": "Howdy."}, {"start": 427.39017, "end": 427.91016, "text": "Whoa."}, {"start": 435.23016, "end": 436.15015, "text": "Can't be too careful."}, {"start": 437.27017, "end": 437.83017, "text": "I understand."}, {"start": 437.83017, "end": 441.51013, "text": "Hey Shirley"}, {"start": 441.51013, "end": 442.79016, "text": "Welcome back"}, {"start": 442.79016, "end": 447.125276, "text": "You don know me Hmm"}, {"start": 447.125276, "end": 450.7759, "text": "Okay You know me"}, {"start": 456.2959, "end": 457.7359, "text": "This place is all right."}, {"start": 458.25592, "end": 459.1759, "text": "Yeah, it's okay."}, {"start": 459.53592, "end": 461.2959, "text": "These pictures must be up all the regulars."}, {"start": 461.59592, "end": 463.0559, "text": "You think someday I can make it up to this wall?"}, {"start": 463.8559, "end": 467.25592, "text": "I don't say this often, Troy, but dream a little smaller."}, {"start": 468.7159, "end": 470.03592, "text": "Can I get you guys anything?"}, {"start": 470.03592, "end": 470.525915, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 470.525915, "end": 471.9959, "text": "I'm okay."}, {"start": 472.5559, "end": 473.5295518181818, "text": "Another Macallan?"}, {"start": 473.5295518181818, "end": 473.81592, "text": "Neat?"}, {"start": 473.81592, "end": 475.2759, "text": "Vodka neat for olives."}, {"start": 475.2759, "end": 476.25592, "text": "I'm waiting till midnight."}, {"start": 476.41592, "end": 476.8559, "text": "Aww."}, {"start": 477.7759, "end": 478.25592, "text": "Sweetie?"}, {"start": 480.3759, "end": 480.8559, "text": "Water."}, {"start": 481.03592, "end": 482.2359, "text": "Where's that accent from?"}, {"start": 482.3359, "end": 483.75592, "text": "Corpus Christi, Texas."}, {"start": 485.4559, "end": 485.9359, "text": "78418."}, {"start": 486.09592, "end": 486.9959, "text": "What are you doing here in town?"}, {"start": 487.09592, "end": 487.9559, "text": "Not much."}, {"start": 488.07593, "end": 492.1759, "text": "I reckon just drifting, floating, spitting in the wind."}, {"start": 493.09592, "end": 494.63592, "text": "General waywardness."}, {"start": 495.4959, "end": 495.97592, "text": "Alrighty."}, {"start": 497.31592, "end": 499.03592, "text": "Annie, you're in the bar."}, {"start": 499.13592, "end": 500.9559, "text": "You don't have to be from Texas anymore."}, {"start": 500.9559, "end": 501.9359, "text": "I don't know how it works."}, {"start": 502.0159, "end": 503.1159, "text": "I'm not a bar flight beretta."}, {"start": 503.2759, "end": 503.8759, "text": "They have asteroids."}, {"start": 504.0559, "end": 504.3959, "text": "Slide out."}, {"start": 504.3959, "end": 506.2159, "text": "Okay, okay, oh, oh, okay."}, {"start": 507.03592, "end": 509.09592, "text": "I'm gonna go take a little look around."}, {"start": 509.4559, "end": 509.8559, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 510.2959, "end": 512.3759, "text": "Annie, don't accept any drinks."}, {"start": 512.4558999999999, "end": 514.1559, "text": "Or invitations to the bathroom."}, {"start": 515.2159399999999, "end": 517.9758999999999, "text": "So what are you gonna order for your first legal drink?"}, {"start": 518.3959299999999, "end": 519.1559, "text": "What should I get?"}, {"start": 519.2759, "end": 519.95593, "text": "Whatever you want."}, {"start": 520.0758999999999, "end": 520.9159, "text": "No wrong answers."}, {"start": 521.0958999999999, "end": 521.7759, "text": "I like beer."}, {"start": 521.9159, "end": 522.6359, "text": "Don't order beer."}, {"start": 522.7959, "end": 523.3359399999999, "text": "You've had beer."}, {"start": 524.5958999999999, "end": 525.6359, "text": "What should I get?"}, {"start": 526.1559, "end": 527.3158999999999, "text": "Well, what do you think you might like?"}, {"start": 527.9159, "end": 528.9159, "text": "It's your world now."}, {"start": 529.0758999999999, "end": 529.9159, "text": "Follow your heart."}, {"start": 530.7559, "end": 532.45593, "text": "My Uncle Carl played a big role in my life."}, {"start": 532.7358999999999, "end": 534.0758999999999, "text": "He taught me how to throw a football."}, {"start": 534.3959299999999, "end": 536.6359, "text": "He passed away this year."}, {"start": 537.2559, "end": 538.7358999999999, "text": "His favorite drink was a 7 and 7."}, {"start": 540.7559, "end": 541.2559, "text": "Don't order that."}, {"start": 541.2559, "end": 542.2559, "text": "That's an awful drink."}, {"start": 542.3158999999999, "end": 542.7358999999999, "text": "You're better than that."}, {"start": 542.7358999999999, "end": 543.1816142857142, "text": "It's horrible."}, {"start": 543.1816142857142, "end": 544.2959, "text": "It's a high school drink for girls."}, {"start": 544.5159, "end": 547.2759, "text": "Actually, I'll have a root beer instead of that water."}, {"start": 547.5559, "end": 548.0359, "text": "Sure thing."}, {"start": 548.3359399999999, "end": 548.9958999999999, "text": "Thank you kindly."}, {"start": 550.2959, "end": 551.6958999999999, "text": "Y'all are so nice in this town."}, {"start": 552.9958999999999, "end": 553.8558999999999, "text": "I'm Caroline."}, {"start": 554.7159399999999, "end": 555.8959299999999, "text": "From Corpus Christi."}, {"start": 556.8359399999999, "end": 558.2759, "text": "Grew up on a trout farm."}, {"start": 559.45593, "end": 560.1958999999999, "text": "Deedle-a-doo."}, {"start": 560.9958999999999, "end": 561.9958999999999, "text": "Do-de-do-doos."}, {"start": 562.9958999999999, "end": 564.0359, "text": "Oh, careful."}, {"start": 564.3959299999999, "end": 566.5032740566037, "text": "You score any higher on this thing, the Rylands are"}, {"start": 566.5032740566037, "end": 568.7759, "text": "going to recruit you to fight against the Kodan Empire."}, {"start": 569.2759, "end": 570.1759, "text": "The last Starfighter."}, {"start": 570.8359399999999, "end": 572.2759, "text": "Did you get the 25th anniversary Blu-ray?"}, {"start": 572.95593, "end": 575.2959, "text": "Was Scorpius half-Scaron, half-Peacekeeper?"}, {"start": 575.5159, "end": 577.8959, "text": "Frel, yes, I got Starfighter on Blu-ray."}, {"start": 579.8158999999999, "end": 581.7959, "text": "You're a fan of the sci-fi original series Farscape."}, {"start": 583.5559, "end": 584.45593, "text": "Can I buy you a drink?"}, {"start": 591.7959, "end": 592.5559, "text": "You got some, IG?"}, {"start": 594.3959, "end": 595.5359, "text": "Very funny, punk."}, {"start": 596.0359, "end": 596.8558999999999, "text": "Get out of my way!"}, {"start": 598.7159399999999, "end": 599.95593, "text": "I don't know how people like you."}, {"start": 600.0, "end": 602.2, "text": "You need help, man?"}, {"start": 602.32, "end": 603.8999999, "text": "Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you?"}, {"start": 604.16, "end": 604.5652631026315, "text": "Ha, ha."}, {"start": 604.5652631026315, "end": 606.3599997, "text": "A little turning of the tables."}, {"start": 607.08, "end": 607.2, "text": "Ha."}, {"start": 608.98, "end": 610.16, "text": "Turning of what tables?"}, {"start": 610.179999, "end": 610.7742851785714, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 610.7742851785714, "end": 611.46, "text": "Leave me alone."}, {"start": 616.32, "end": 618.9, "text": "So I punched her right in the face."}, {"start": 619.18, "end": 620.359999, "text": "Your probation officer?"}, {"start": 621.119999, "end": 621.98, "text": "Didn't you get in trouble?"}, {"start": 622.6, "end": 624.439999, "text": "Hell yes, I got in trouble."}, {"start": 624.74, "end": 625.983, "text": "Wasn't the first time."}, {"start": 625.983, "end": 627.0, "text": "Won't be the last."}, {"start": 627.32, "end": 629.58, "text": "Not exactly known for my sound judgment."}, {"start": 630.0, "end": 633.14, "text": "Back in Corpus Christi, they called me Capricious Caroline."}, {"start": 633.96, "end": 634.94, "text": "What's Capricious mean?"}, {"start": 636.74, "end": 641.88, "text": "Probably means I'm too busy living life to be learning five-dollar words."}, {"start": 642.42, "end": 644.46, "text": "Hot damn!"}, {"start": 644.68, "end": 646.48, "text": "With an aged scotch, never use ice."}, {"start": 646.82, "end": 647.6333333333333, "text": "Never use ice."}, {"start": 647.6333333333333, "end": 648.04, "text": "Got it."}, {"start": 648.22, "end": 648.61, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 648.61, "end": 649.78, "text": "Destroys it."}, {"start": 650.36, "end": 653.02, "text": "At most, what you want, two drops of spring water."}, {"start": 653.32, "end": 654.3, "text": "Activates the flavor."}, {"start": 654.3, "end": 654.7869565217391, "text": "Good Lord."}, {"start": 654.7869565217391, "end": 658.78, "text": "Do they have the rules to high-maintenance poser drinking on the wall at L Street?"}, {"start": 658.92, "end": 659.34, "text": "Do they?"}, {"start": 660.0, "end": 663.0, "text": "What's that called, the too-cool-to-care-tini?"}, {"start": 663.0, "end": 664.0, "text": "Is it?"}, {"start": 664.0, "end": 666.1666666666666, "text": "I bet the forced starkness of that drink order turns"}, {"start": 666.1666666666666, "end": 668.0, "text": "a lot of horn-groomed heads at the red door."}, {"start": 668.0, "end": 670.0, "text": "I can't wait to understand these arguments."}, {"start": 670.0, "end": 672.0, "text": "Hey, y'all, another round for you."}, {"start": 672.0, "end": 677.1961377272727, "text": "Everybody holding up I be back in two shakes of a rabbit ass"}, {"start": 677.1961377272727, "end": 681.8726616818182, "text": "Who the hell was that I gotta go see a woman about the"}, {"start": 681.8726616818182, "end": 687.242004, "text": "female equivalent of a horse Classy Way to show Troy the ropes"}, {"start": 687.362, "end": 688.502, "text": "Shut up, L Street."}, {"start": 691.282, "end": 692.462, "text": "That woman is a hurricane."}, {"start": 693.702, "end": 694.102005, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 695.962, "end": 697.042, "text": "Hurricanes are bad, Troy."}, {"start": 697.222, "end": 697.662, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 697.662, "end": 702.9454814956522, "text": "I always thought it's possible that the wormhole Crichton fell"}, {"start": 702.9454814956522, "end": 707.462006, "text": "through moved him across not only space but also time"}, {"start": 707.462006, "end": 710.002, "text": "Which would suggest that the Sabatians are our future selves"}, {"start": 710.002, "end": 712.182, "text": "And Crichton is longing for a planet that no longer exists"}, {"start": 712.182, "end": 712.701996, "text": "Huh"}, {"start": 712.701996, "end": 715.322, "text": "Hey, you're really nursing that beer"}, {"start": 715.322, "end": 721.502, "text": "Which would make sense because what kind of wormhole would it be"}, {"start": 721.502, "end": 722.7764204651162, "text": "If you could only move from one place to"}, {"start": 722.7764204651162, "end": 724.242004, "text": "another within the same galaxy on the same day"}, {"start": 724.242004, "end": 725.642, "text": "You know, speaking of wormholes"}, {"start": 725.642, "end": 727.4874545454545, "text": "What do you say we use one to"}, {"start": 727.4874545454545, "end": 731.242, "text": "teleport this conversation someplace a little more private?"}, {"start": 731.722, "end": 732.562, "text": "That doesn't make any sense."}, {"start": 733.422, "end": 735.0219999999999, "text": "Wormholes and teleportation are two different things."}, {"start": 735.462, "end": 736.582, "text": "That's what I've been talking about this whole time."}, {"start": 736.582, "end": 737.062, "text": "I noticed."}, {"start": 738.342, "end": 738.702, "text": "Cheers."}, {"start": 739.202, "end": 740.6320059090909, "text": "I followed that band Fish."}, {"start": 740.6320059090909, "end": 741.62201, "text": "Spells it with PH."}, {"start": 742.082, "end": 743.802, "text": "I just lived in parking lots wherever they played."}, {"start": 744.002, "end": 745.0686666666667, "text": "I don't even like their music."}, {"start": 745.0686666666667, "end": 746.242, "text": "Just did to see if I could do it."}, {"start": 746.262, "end": 747.2924347826087, "text": "And guess what?"}, {"start": 747.2924347826087, "end": 747.842, "text": "I could."}, {"start": 747.942, "end": 748.442, "text": "So what now?"}, {"start": 748.582, "end": 749.282, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 749.922, "end": 753.90201, "text": "Even if I planned it, plans just fall off me like chicken crap off an armadillo."}, {"start": 753.90201, "end": 758.5070806896551, "text": "Annie the one who plans things not me Annie my friend She goes to"}, {"start": 758.5070806896551, "end": 763.2538458620689, "text": "school here Thinks she got it all figured out She wants to major in"}, {"start": 763.2538458620689, "end": 768.284, "text": "health care management What does that even mean No idea I tell you what"}, {"start": 768.284, "end": 768.80525, "text": "it means."}, {"start": 768.80525, "end": 771.8748333333334, "text": "It means a master's degree followed by an internship."}, {"start": 771.8748333333334, "end": 773.844, "text": "She's got the next 15 years of her"}, {"start": 773.844, "end": 778.4454893617021, "text": "life all mapped out and all she's got to do now is just follow it or screw it up."}, {"start": 778.4454893617021, "end": 779.184, "text": "Another soda?"}, {"start": 779.184, "end": 781.184, "text": "Actually, give me a screwdriver."}, {"start": 781.184, "end": 783.184, "text": "I got no place to be."}, {"start": 783.184, "end": 785.184, "text": "What am I, Annie?"}, {"start": 785.184, "end": 789.184, "text": "The first season when you watch it the second time is better than the third season."}, {"start": 789.184, "end": 791.184, "text": "And the fourth season when you watch it the fifth time is equal to..."}, {"start": 791.184, "end": 793.184, "text": "Okay, um, what's your name?"}, {"start": 793.184, "end": 794.184, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 794.184, "end": 794.4965, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 794.4965, "end": 795.184, "text": "I'm Robert."}, {"start": 795.184, "end": 796.184, "text": "Hey, Robert."}, {"start": 796.184, "end": 800.184, "text": "Abed, would you like to have gay sex with me?"}, {"start": 800.184, "end": 802.184, "text": "No, thank you."}, {"start": 802.184, "end": 803.184, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 803.184, "end": 807.61509375, "text": "Okay, so what is wrong with you that you can sit here this whole time"}, {"start": 807.61509375, "end": 811.404, "text": "and never pick up on the fact that a man is hitting on you?"}, {"start": 811.4639999999999, "end": 812.764, "text": "Oh, I actually did pick up on it after a while."}, {"start": 812.844, "end": 814.364, "text": "You actually..."}, {"start": 814.364, "end": 815.304, "text": "And?"}, {"start": 815.744, "end": 817.48401, "text": "I really, really like talking about Farscape."}, {"start": 822.2239999999999, "end": 823.18399, "text": "It's a really good show."}, {"start": 823.92401, "end": 824.68399, "text": "Stargate's better."}, {"start": 829.42401, "end": 830.5840000000001, "text": "Battery depleted."}, {"start": 830.5840000000001, "end": 831.544, "text": "Oh, man."}, {"start": 833.18399, "end": 834.02399, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 842.18399, "end": 845.0017767391304, "text": "Oh Hey there what you went up to I was"}, {"start": 845.0017767391304, "end": 849.006, "text": "just praying for these poor souls in these photographs"}, {"start": 849.006, "end": 852.486, "text": "Oh, that's nice, but you missed one."}, {"start": 853.10599, "end": 855.54599, "text": "Because we found it in the ladies' room."}, {"start": 856.806, "end": 857.6659999999999, "text": "Give that to me."}, {"start": 857.6859999999999, "end": 858.8948838095238, "text": "No, no, come on."}, {"start": 858.8948838095238, "end": 860.0282123809524, "text": "Don't feel bad."}, {"start": 860.0282123809524, "end": 862.44598, "text": "This makes us like you way more."}, {"start": 862.626, "end": 863.50598, "text": "I think this is really funny."}, {"start": 863.6659999999999, "end": 863.906, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 863.906, "end": 866.4259999999999, "text": "I had some bad years."}, {"start": 867.606, "end": 868.5659800000001, "text": "With the chaser."}, {"start": 868.6859999999999, "end": 869.466, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 869.6659999999999, "end": 872.5659800000001, "text": "It's a funny picture because you act so perfect all the time."}, {"start": 872.746, "end": 874.386, "text": "And because you look like a zombie."}, {"start": 874.5260000000001, "end": 875.906, "text": "But it's not funny when you're sad."}, {"start": 876.466, "end": 877.406, "text": "We're on your team."}, {"start": 877.546, "end": 877.94598, "text": "Relax."}, {"start": 878.046, "end": 878.4259999999999, "text": "Sit down."}, {"start": 878.486, "end": 879.126, "text": "It's my birthday."}, {"start": 879.546, "end": 880.1859999999999, "text": "Give it to me."}, {"start": 881.246, "end": 881.846, "text": "Give it to me."}, {"start": 884.046, "end": 885.086, "text": "See you all on Monday."}, {"start": 889.366, "end": 889.7660000000001, "text": "Shirley."}, {"start": 891.886, "end": 892.2860000000001, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 893.906, "end": 894.906, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 894.906, "end": 895.2136923076922, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 895.2136923076922, "end": 895.906, "text": "Get out of my way."}, {"start": 895.906, "end": 897.906, "text": "I can't get out of your way."}, {"start": 897.906, "end": 898.9494782608696, "text": "I'm stuck in this place."}, {"start": 898.9494782608696, "end": 899.906, "text": "The chair broke the..."}, {"start": 899.906, "end": 901.906, "text": "I mean, I can't get..."}, {"start": 902.906, "end": 904.906, "text": "Could you please help me?"}, {"start": 905.906, "end": 906.906, "text": "Pretty please?"}, {"start": 908.906, "end": 909.906, "text": "Thank you, Shirley."}, {"start": 910.906, "end": 912.906, "text": "You're welcome, jackass."}, {"start": 914.906, "end": 918.065011235955, "text": "Hey, it's my birthday, and technically I'm not"}, {"start": 918.065011235955, "end": 921.018, "text": "allowed to drink it for another 45 seconds."}, {"start": 921.018, "end": 923.3533190297873, "text": "Well, actually, it'll be 30 seconds by the time I'm done"}, {"start": 923.3533190297873, "end": 924.9379998000001, "text": "saying this, but can I have a 7 and 7?"}, {"start": 925.918, "end": 926.8843157894737, "text": "It's on the house."}, {"start": 926.8843157894737, "end": 927.9580000000001, "text": "Happy birthday, kid."}, {"start": 937.398, "end": 940.877999, "text": "Not to hurt her as a radio player would be totally horrible and stupid."}, {"start": 940.877999, "end": 942.377999, "text": "He would be with Beth."}, {"start": 948.377999, "end": 950.4780000000001, "text": "Big boy, big, big boy."}, {"start": 951.018, "end": 953.018, "text": "My big boy."}, {"start": 973.018, "end": 974.018, "text": "Troy."}, {"start": 976.018, "end": 978.018, "text": "I think I owe you a birthday."}, {"start": 978.018, "end": 979.018, "text": "I'm cool."}, {"start": 979.018, "end": 981.778, "text": "I actually always wanted to drive this thing."}, {"start": 981.778, "end": 983.238, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 983.238, "end": 985.738, "text": "Oh, this is my car?"}, {"start": 985.738, "end": 986.618, "text": "Don't crash it."}, {"start": 986.618, "end": 987.778, "text": "I'm not gonna crash it."}, {"start": 987.778, "end": 988.738, "text": "Crash it, Troy."}, {"start": 988.738, "end": 990.158, "text": "Go to sleep, Britta, go to sleep."}, {"start": 990.158, "end": 992.258, "text": "Crash his car, Troy."}, {"start": 992.258, "end": 994.5980000000001, "text": "Seems like a really dark chapter in our group story."}, {"start": 994.5980000000001, "end": 1000.6327698666668, "text": "Go see Bobbin Cool Hey that the place that we shoulda gone to tonight Yeah L"}, {"start": 1000.6327698666668, "end": 1006.50873, "text": "Street exactly Is this a red door stupid You see a sign that says L Street"}, {"start": 1006.6487400000001, "end": 1008.36873, "text": "L Street is too cool to have a sign."}, {"start": 1008.4487300000001, "end": 1010.60874, "text": "It's called L Street after the street it's on."}, {"start": 1012.22873, "end": 1014.248736, "text": "The red door is on L Street."}, {"start": 1014.5687350000001, "end": 1015.8287300000001, "text": "L Street has a red door."}, {"start": 1019.04873, "end": 1021.08873, "text": "It's the same bar."}, {"start": 1021.76873, "end": 1023.98873, "text": "You two have been saying one bar is lame"}, {"start": 1023.98873, "end": 1026.8487340000001, "text": "and the other one is awesome all night"}, {"start": 1026.8487340000001, "end": 1030.50874, "text": "and it's the same bar?"}, {"start": 1033.568735, "end": 1036.54873, "text": "Well, he probably was there on Friday nights, which is lame."}, {"start": 1036.58873, "end": 1037.26873, "text": "You wish."}, {"start": 1037.3487340000001, "end": 1037.6287300000001, "text": "Stop."}, {"start": 1038.48873, "end": 1039.08873, "text": "Just stop."}, {"start": 1039.18873, "end": 1040.80873, "text": "I just spent the last two years"}, {"start": 1040.80873, "end": 1042.98873, "text": "thinking that you guys knew more than me about life"}, {"start": 1042.98873, "end": 1046.80873, "text": "and I just found out that you guys are just as dumb as me."}, {"start": 1048.94873, "end": 1049.34873, "text": "Dadoy."}, {"start": 1049.92874, "end": 1051.3887300000001, "text": "Yeah, dadoy."}, {"start": 1051.3887300000001, "end": 1054.10873, "text": "Got it."}, {"start": 1055.32873, "end": 1055.82873, "text": "DeJoy."}, {"start": 1057.92874, "end": 1058.44873, "text": "DeJoy."}, {"start": 1059.44873, "end": 1060.7116332258065, "text": "You can take me home first."}, {"start": 1060.7116332258065, "end": 1062.34873, "text": "I only live a few blocks from here."}, {"start": 1062.64874, "end": 1063.06872, "text": "You do?"}, {"start": 1063.70873, "end": 1065.94873, "text": "Hey, this is a really terrible neighborhood."}, {"start": 1066.22872, "end": 1066.3687400000001, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1069.82873, "end": 1071.14874, "text": "This is my apartment."}, {"start": 1073.50872, "end": 1076.9563720856147, "text": "Weird night huh Yeah Alcohol makes people sad It"}, {"start": 1076.9563720856147, "end": 1080.5476763414633, "text": "like the Lifetime movies of beverages I pretend to"}, {"start": 1080.5476763414633, "end": 1086.37792300813, "text": "be a different person at night Abba does that like three times a week But I did it"}, {"start": 1086.37792300813, "end": 1090.99946, "text": "because I didn want to be me I did it because I not sure who I am"}, {"start": 1091.67947, "end": 1094.93946, "text": "Admit it, we went to school together for four years and you didn't even know me."}, {"start": 1095.0594700000001, "end": 1097.3357792105264, "text": "Yeah, but I know you now."}, {"start": 1097.3357792105264, "end": 1098.51946, "text": "You're Annie."}, {"start": 1099.07946, "end": 1103.3594600000001, "text": "You like puzzles and little monsters on your pencil and some guy named Mark Ruffalo."}, {"start": 1103.3594600000001, "end": 1106.8594600000001, "text": "You're a fierce competitor and a sore loser."}, {"start": 1106.8594600000001, "end": 1110.8594600000001, "text": "And you expect everybody to be better than who they are,"}, {"start": 1110.8594600000001, "end": 1113.8594600000001, "text": "and you expect yourself to be better than everyone."}, {"start": 1113.8594600000001, "end": 1116.8594600000001, "text": "Which is cool."}, {"start": 1123.8594600000001, "end": 1125.8594600000001, "text": "Good night."}, {"start": 1127.8594600000001, "end": 1130.8594600000001, "text": "Guess everyone's gonna be pretty embarrassed on Monday, huh?"}, {"start": 1130.8594600000001, "end": 1132.95947, "text": "Nah, everybody just got a little bit drunk."}, {"start": 1133.79946, "end": 1135.23947, "text": "Nobody did anything that bad, right?"}, {"start": 1141.91946, "end": 1143.15946, "text": "Wait, wait, wait."}, {"start": 1144.73947, "end": 1145.69946, "text": "What are we doing?"}, {"start": 1146.23947, "end": 1147.99948, "text": "Yeah, what are we doing?"}, {"start": 1148.21946, "end": 1149.75946, "text": "This is a bad idea, right?"}, {"start": 1150.49948, "end": 1150.93946, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1150.93946, "end": 1151.01946, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1159.17947, "end": 1164.2702, "text": "Okay I flew off the handle earlier"}, {"start": 1165.8502, "end": 1166.6702, "text": "I apologize."}, {"start": 1171.3302, "end": 1172.2702, "text": "They were making out."}, {"start": 1172.4902, "end": 1172.8902, "text": "Abed!"}, {"start": 1173.3102000000001, "end": 1174.0902, "text": "Why would you say that?"}, {"start": 1174.1902, "end": 1175.0811090909092, "text": "Why would you do it in front of me?"}, {"start": 1175.0811090909092, "end": 1175.5902, "text": "I'm not a coat rack."}, {"start": 1177.1902, "end": 1177.5902, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1178.4102, "end": 1179.8302, "text": "No one likes a tattletale."}, {"start": 1182.9502, "end": 1184.2302, "text": "Happy birthday, Troy."}, {"start": 1184.4302, "end": 1186.7302, "text": "Thanks."}, {"start": 1188.4702, "end": 1189.3502, "text": "You're a man now."}, {"start": 1201.9102, "end": 1203.2702, "text": "I don't think this is going to be big enough."}, {"start": 1203.4502, "end": 1204.1790888888888, "text": "Just try it."}, {"start": 1204.1790888888888, "end": 1205.0902, "text": "We're so close."}, {"start": 1205.5302000000001, "end": 1205.987342857143, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1205.987342857143, "end": 1206.4902, "text": "Breathe in."}, {"start": 1208.4902, "end": 1208.9902, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1211.5502000000001, "end": 1211.9102, "text": "Arms."}, {"start": 1212.79022, "end": 1213.302212, "text": "There we go."}, {"start": 1213.302212, "end": 1214.0702, "text": "There we go again."}, {"start": 1214.4302, "end": 1220.4702, "text": "157."}, {"start": 1220.5702, "end": 1221.0902, "text": "We did it!"}, {"start": 1221.1702, "end": 1221.5702, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1226.0261999999998, "end": 1226.6661999999997, "text": "A little help?"}, {"start": 1228.0661999999998, "end": 1229.1861999999999, "text": "Hurry, I think it's a girl."}, {"start": 1229.7861999999998, "end": 1230.4861999999998, "text": "Left side or right side?"}, {"start": 1230.7661999999998, "end": 1231.1661999999997, "text": "Left side."}, {"start": 1231.2461799999999, "end": 1231.4861999999998, "text": "Got it."}, {"start": 1231.8862, "end": 1232.7261999999998, "text": "Tell me when I'm close."}, {"start": 1233.0061999999998, "end": 1233.3261999999997, "text": "Okay."}]}